    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "This suffix, meaning to start doing something, must be distinguished from a host of compound verbs ending in \"dasu,\" such as 乗り出す(launch), 染出す (dye), 積み出す, (send off), など。I believe it is new Level ３．",
      "html": "This suffix, meaning to start doing something, must be distinguished from a host of compound verbs ending in \"dasu,\" such as 乗り出す(launch), 染出す (dye), 積み出す, (send off), など。I believe it is new Level ３．",
      "credits_raw": "american57",
      "source_id": null,
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    }
  ],
